          "type": "note",
          "html": "<b>Recommended</b>: <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Beast_of_Burden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Beast of Burden</a>, as to not make return trips. Take items from the next step with you if using a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/BoB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BoB</a>. Note any familiar must be overridden by another pet to be allowed into <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Entrana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Entrana</a>."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:mykiln",
          "html": "If you don&#39;t have a sack of potatoes yet, fill an empty sack with potatoes in the farm north-east of Auguste. Pick the 6 that are there, wait for more to respawn, then pick 4 more. Click fill on the sack.",
          "text": "If you don't have a sack of potatoes yet, fill an empty sack with potatoes in the farm north-east of Auguste. Pick the 6 that are there, wait for more to respawn, then pick 4 more. Click fill on the sack.",
